    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a patch with spherical influence. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_spherical_patch" kindref="compound">SphericalPatch</ref> class is a concrete implementation of <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref>. The patch influence is defined by a center point and a radius, forming a spherical area in which the patch exerts its effects. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
